      <p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);max-width:540px;margin:0 0 28px;">An independent structural engineer looks at the cracks, the floors and the roof, works out the likely cause and grades the damage in a written report. Call (08) 5550 6237 and we'll pass your details to the engineer who quotes the job.</p>
